{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ed9945e83c5e777bdddd992a412c30246f7b56e76a323cb44e578352927d7a2d","ja":"年こしそば、おいしかったね！\n他のみんなは何時に来るの！？","zh":"跨年荞麦面真好吃呢！\n其他大家几点会过来呀！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"90e439283fb65fa05392fa88b8716908a141ceb89156b94d66c00a6203520a31","ja":"何か準備することある？\nわたし、お手伝いするよ！","zh":"有什么要准备的吗？\n我来帮忙吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6eedfc3d14140e72ca2db3a7a32a95a5d3a5ef93f0c6b304eedd8c94f841a437","ja":"まあまあ、まだ時間はたっぷりあるんだから。\n焦らなくっていいわよ。","zh":"好啦好啦，时间还很充裕呢。\n不用着急哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"88454e457f1b3146d13aff66432f7735740da37c1615b24618a72bb514f4c8be","ja":"ホットミルクでも飲みましょうか。\nその後は、歯磨きもしっかりね。","zh":"喝点热牛奶吧。\n之后也别忘了好好刷牙哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e1d7915b0822c99c444d5dcbf8de4d3de13981a15113b50235bc786e07c4d95d","ja":"ホットミルクとはみがきって……もしかして、\nわたしたちのこと、ねかせようとしてない？","zh":"热牛奶加刷牙……该不会，\n是想哄我们睡觉吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"682d4a9060db2404de00b51e36103cfa0bb6c3ff954f88bbcf7b9db5e5641680","ja":"ええ～！？　じゃあたまき、ホットミルク飲まない！\n……飲みたいけど。","zh":"诶诶～！？那环不喝热牛奶了！\n……虽然很想喝就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"030b67bb0b13862aba3998b7a624925f3f7afae5c6b379dc53c5fc063a849ff4","ja":"なら、我慢しなくていいじゃない。飲み物を用意して、\n年末のテレビを見たり、本を読んだり……。","zh":"那就不必忍着了呀。准备好饮料，\n看看年末的电视节目，读读书……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"64df1a8c43643ac003f5fd3f46b193abc00802404795ca066948a84a1be579fd","ja":"そういうゆったりとした大人の過ごし方も、\nふたりに体験してもらえたら、って思ったんだけど？","zh":"我也想让你们两个人，\n体验一下这种从容惬意的大人生活方式呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b3663660d3200248c61f4764b572cd3f712c56f47ba6a574f7934fd2e3c656d7","ja":"そうだったんだ……！　じゃあわたし、\nホットミルクを用意してから、本を読むね♪","zh":"原来是这样啊……！那我先去\n热一杯牛奶，然后再看书吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d627aa8cb9c445010092162ff476294c38f22a331d8083f4173c4872fbf5dab4","ja":"じゃあたまきは、テレビを見るぞ♪\nどれが面白いかな～。","zh":"那环要去看电视喽♪\n看哪个比较有意思呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1369d07edf6ccc7737193384a8dd070f23b50b1b31761344da18c74da6c1f575","ja":"（少し難しいけど読みごたえがある本を教えて、\nテレビの音量も下げておきましょうか……）","zh":"（推荐几本稍微有点难但读起来很有收获的书，\n再把电视的音量也调小吧……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2","ja":"1時間後……","zh":"一个小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c7d7bf86aaff7d98fd016c0636da623a74a71f6c3185df564e81c29c98282f2c","ja":"すぅーすぅー……","zh":"呼——呼——……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b79165669cc2880f6d69e1bca5908c99cce3283ccde38b14503f5ac96c219234","ja":"むにゃむにゃ……","zh":"唔喵唔喵……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a0ddb7cb1b01e9ad8dfbeef3651472f80e503f3ae7e2c6d46d3d9c341a960d05","ja":"（ふふ、かわいい寝顔♪　それじゃ、\nさっきご家族と打ち合わせた通りに……）","zh":"（呵呵，可爱的睡脸♪ 那么，\n就按照刚才跟家属商量好的那样……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"8d482f1ff7045bdcc6927334f8099fa2962559a50243613852af80c61a352e2c","ja":"……はい、無事に眠ったので、お迎えをお願いします。\nいえ、別にたいしたことでは……。","zh":"……好的，已经顺利睡下了，麻烦您来接一下吧。\n不，并没有什么大不了的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1695.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8945c4b2164d5085aa39bca5d9032af9ca94d54374ee2fd89048ac2e1407e9ed","ja":"私が、できるだけ付き合ってあげたかったんです。\n大人っぽい年越しに憧れる気持ち、わかりますから♪","zh":"我想尽可能多陪陪她。\n因为我很理解憧憬像个大人一样跨年的心情呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
